# r1111 SQ-SCAT on a fresh level with level-type creativedevtools:structure_catalogue (first boot). scat2.qb = second boot.
pace 2

## SQ-SCAT-07 | preview counts while the build runs
> cdevplace catalogue preview
sleep 5
look preview counts line (pieces, whole, unmapped, skipped biome markers, entity pieces, replaced, placed whole); compare with the report counts after SQ-SCAT-08

## SQ-SCAT-06 | first boot: plan logged, gamerules, spawn
bootexpect \[catalogue\] new Structure Catalogue world
bootexpect \[catalogue\] plan:
> gamerule doMobSpawning
> gamerule doFireTick
> gamerule doWeatherCycle
shell grep -E "^(level-type|level-name)" server.properties
> execute in minecraft:overworld run data get entity @r Pos
look gamerules false; build started; spawn checked from level.dat after the stop (0 65 0)

## SQ-SCAT-08 | build finishes; record time, refusals, heap
> cdevplace catalogue status
waitlog Structure Catalogue built 14400
> cdevplace catalogue status
reject Watchdog|OutOfMemoryError|\[catalogue\] build aborted
shell python3 -c 'import json;d=json.load(open("kubejs/exported/structure_catalogue_report.json"));print({k:d[k] for k in d if k in ("counts","seconds","secs","refused_count")});r=d.get("refused",[]);print(len(r));[print(x) for x in (r[:60] if isinstance(r,list) else list(r.items())[:60])]' 2>&1 | cut -c1-300
shell grep -cE "\[catalogue\] .* failed" logs/latest.log; true
look build ended; RECORD seconds, refused count, ids and reasons
